## Scope

:::non-goals
- No requirements-management tool.
- No test runner integration.
:::

::::requirement{#R1 priority=P1 status=accepted} Export documents to PDF
The CLI writes a PDF of the rendered page.

:::acceptance{#AC1}
Given a document
When it is exported with --to pdf
Then a PDF file is written
:::
::::

## Examples

