## Known issues

:::limitation{#L1 affects=R1 owner=@cli-team} PDF export needs a local browser
Workaround: export HTML and print it.
:::

:::limitation{#L2 status=resolved affects=R1} Fonts were missing in PDFs
Fixed by embedding them.
:::

